<title>USA: NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-ROAD TO THE SUPER BOWL FOR GREEN BAY, NEW ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-ROAD TO THE SUPER BOWL FOR GREEN BAY, NEW ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Football</p>
<p>League playoff road to the Super Bowl, where the Green Bay</p>
<p>Packers and New England Patriots meet for the NFL title on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>WILD CARD ROUND</p>
<p>Saturday, December 28</p>
<p> Jacksonville   30  BUFFALO	27</p>
<p> DALLAS	   40  Minnesota    15</p>
<p>Sunday, December 29</p>
<p> PITTSBURGH     42  Indianapolis 14</p>
<p> SAN FRANCISCO  14  Philadelphia  0</p>
<p>DIVISIONAL PLAYOFFS</p>
<p>Saturday, January 4</p>
<p> GREEN BAY	35  San Francisco 14</p>
<p> Jacksonville   30  DENVER	  27</p>
<p>Sunday, January 5</p>
<p> NEW ENGLAND    28  Pittsburgh     3</p>
<p> CAROLINA	 26  Dallas	  17</p>
<p>CONFERENCE CHAMPIONSHIPS</p>
<p>Sunday, January 12</p>
<p> GREEN BAY	30  Carolina	13</p>
<p> NEW ENGLAND    20  JACKSONVILLE   6</p>
<p>SUPER BOWL XXXI at New Orleans</p>
<p>Sunday, January 26</p>
<p>New England (13-5) vs Green Bay (15-3)</p>
</text>
